stateDiagram-v2
  Active --> Paused: Teacher pause
  Paused --> Active: Teacher resume
  Active --> Recovering: failure or reconnect required
  Paused --> Recovering: failure or reconnect required
  Recovering --> Active: recover valid checkpoint to active
  Recovering --> Paused: recover valid checkpoint to paused
  note right of Recovering: Return to the last valid state. Receipt and durable boundary require contract and database acceptance.
